# MusicSearch settings. setup creates a copy of this file named ".env".
# Everything here is OPTIONAL: Apple Music and YouTube Music work without it.
#
# Fill these in only if you want Spotify search / Spotify links.
# Get them at https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard :
#   1. Create an app.
#   2. In the app's settings add this Redirect URI exactly:
#        http://127.0.0.1:8888/callback
#   3. Copy the Client ID and Client Secret below (no quotes, no spaces).
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=
